OL,3,ABurnham to face first PMQs as adviser
OL,4,Awarns debt costs will force government
OL,5,Ato 'get real'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will face his first
OL,8,Fsession of Prime Minister's Questions
OL,9,Ftoday - as an adviser warns about the
OL,10,Fgrowing cost of UK borrowing
OL,12,FThe cost of borrowing money for the UK,
OL,13,Fand governments around the world, has
OL,14,Frisen sharply in recent weeks - and is
OL,15,Fup again slightly this morning
OL,17,FLord O'Neill, who advised Burnham as he
OL,18,Fentered Downing Street, says those
OL,19,Fcosts will force Labour to "get real"
OL,20,Fabout "dealing with the [state pension]
OL,21,Ftriple lock" and "excessive" welfare
OL,22,Fspending
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
