OL,3,ABurnham to face first PMQs as adviser
OL,4,Awarns debt costs will force government
OL,5,Ato 'get real'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, Burnham faced MPs for the
OL,8,Ffirst time since becoming PM in July,
OL,9,Fin a session lasting over three hours
OL,11,FHe pledged "stronger public control" of
OL,12,Fessential services - Conservative
OL,13,Fleader Kemi Badenoch said his ideas
OL,14,Fwere just "more government control,
OL,15,Fmore spending, more tax"
